WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:08.501
Systems as a gaffer. Your next two weeks are at the top: booked, on hold, and offered.

2
00:00:08.751 --> 00:00:15.702
An offer comes in from a producer. Tap I'm in, and it's in your diary.

3
00:00:15.952 --> 00:00:24.501
The team timesheet builds everyone's day from one unit call and wrap, plus the riggers who went in early.

4
00:00:24.751 --> 00:00:32.503
Your own deal and each spark's rate go on one department invoice, or split if production wants.

5
00:00:32.753 --> 00:00:40.504
Your lamps, distro and van are saved as kit, priced by the day on their own lines.

6
00:00:40.754 --> 00:00:47.305
And every job has one status, through to paid.

